{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-09-18T14:30:50.055Z","data":{"text":"Task 4 complete. Summary:\n\n## Changed\n\n**`src/watcher/runner.ts`**\n- Added `undeclared_test_change` to `RunTaskFailureReason`.\n- Added `snapshotTestFiles` / `findUndeclaredTestChanges`: recursively fingerprint `tests/**` by sha256 content hash, then report preexisting files whose content changed or that were deleted. Files absent from the snapshot (new tests) are ignored.\n- `runTask` takes the snapshot right before `adapter.spawn` when `testsModify` is false (skipped entirely when true).\n- After a clean agent exit and before result/verify handling, an undeclared change writes `.run/dead/<n>.md` with `reason: undeclared_test_change`, appends the matching `dead` event, and returns without invoking `taskData.verify`.\n\n**`tests/runner-test-gating.test.ts`** (new) — covers the union member, deletion detection, modification dead marker + dead event + verify skip, brand-new test file allowed, and `tests.modify: true` permitting edits. Uses an inline `FileMutatingAdapter` so no out-of-scope files needed changes.\n\n## Verify\n`node --import tsx --test tests/runner-test-gating.test.ts` → 5 pass / 0 fail. `tsc --noEmit` and biome clean.\n\nResult written to `openspec/changes/017-ownership-and-test-gating/.run/results/4.md`. Next acceptance line belongs to Task 5 (status/show/report categorization)."}}
